---

<div class="content-wrapper">

  <!-- ================= ABOUT ME ================= -->
  <section id="about" class="section-container">
    <div class="section-badge">ABOUT ME</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Kenali Lebih <span class="cyan-text">Dekat</span></h2>
    
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-card intro-card">
        <h3>Halo, Saya Isnain Ahmad Jauhari</h3>
        <p>
          Biasa dipanggil <strong>Aril</strong>. Siswa jurusan PPLG di <strong>SMKN 2 Magelang</strong> yang mendalami web development, backend engineering, serta desain visual & video editing.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-card info-card">
        <ul class="info-list">
          <li><span>Sekolah:</span> SMKN 2 Magelang</li>
          <li><span>Fokus:</span> Web Development & Visual Arts</li>
          <li><span>Domisili:</span> Magelang, Jawa Tengah</li>
          <li><span>Status:</span> Pelajar / Open to Collaboration</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= TECH STACK (INFINITE SEAMLESS DUAL MARQUEE) ================= -->
